Media Con is a convention of the media made across [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]], held in downtown [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Terminus|Terminus]] and brought there by the corporation [[Org/Omnivox/index|Omnivox]].

The grounds open onto a fairground of tents and dirt paths, and the crowd mixes two tastes: some come dressed as though for an old faire, and others wear their chrome to the eyes. Real magic and stagecraft share the halls, casters working effects beside people faking them with holograms.

Exhibitors sell old comics and new implants, sponsors give their seminars, and the company's own panel runs through the day with its executives on hand. A cosplay competition closes the convention, its grand prize a stay at the [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Golden Spire|Golden Spire]]. [[Divinity/Immix|Immix]]'s talk show is known here, and [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] as its cast, though few can place them.
